  (hierarchical_label "NANO_TX" (shape bidirectional) (at 66.04 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 59255e8b-f590-425d-a565-655f01818186))
  (wire (pts (xy 55.88 106.68) (xy 66.04 106.68)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid 84ef98f0-5207-46d0-bcee-9aeeb72d58e0))
  (hierarchical_label "NANO_RX" (shape bidirectional) (at 66.04 106.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid bba8c1fb-66ee-4d76-aca3-bc49d5f35a64))
  (text "Reverse protection: AO3401A P-FET (body diode anode at input). The gate is pulled to GND, so Vgs would be -Vin; D1002 (10 V zener, gate to source) holds it at -10 V for any Vin (rating +/-12 V)." (at 30 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 85ca90fe-4ce7-41ab-844c-c0e7ab2fa72e))
  (text "Bulk capacitance: size from breadboard rail-sag measurements. VIN_S = Vin x 18k/118k = 3.2 V at Vin = 21 V, to ADC A3 (scale 0.1525)." (at 30 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e75073f3-aa86-41f9-a6e2-1a67f44e9548))
  (text "Supply ratings (Vin = 21 V now): D1001 SMAJ24A (24 V standoff, clamps near 39 V - above the 30 V Vds of AO3401A / AO3400A, so it only absorbs moderate surges); C1001 35 V, C1002/C1003 50 V X7R. Check the Nano VIN limit against Vin." (at 30 42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid dd20afa5-421c-46b4-a1a0-14b216df6cc8))
  (text "J1001: pin 1 VIN_RAW, pin 2 GND, pin 3 TX, pin 4 RX (Nano D1/TX, D0/RX). GND is shared with the power input; pins 2-4 form a GND / TX / RX UART header. Do not plug a UART cable onto pins 1-2." (at 30 38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a1299cc5-7b30-4e75-b7c0-818126a4d417))
)
